[I] Python bindings for Wayfire's IPC

[T] The Wayfire compositor provides access to its functionalities via
[T] Inter-Process Communication (IPC). This repository contains the source code
[T] for the python client bindings, as well as hosts many examples of how to
[T] use the IPC.

